# The deepest nesting through an item's Loans tab: the location tree,
# the contents of the office, item 1 there in its form, its Loans tab, a
# new reservation's form, the item pick list of its host for "Deep" and
# the help over that.  Each list on the way is paged to its end and back
# first (End, Home), so that it holds its ring of page cursors.
#@ DEEP
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L
T B
K END HOME ENTER END HOME ENTER ALT-C A END HOME INS DOWN ENTER
K TAB TAB
T Deep
K F4 END HOME
S DEEPHOLD
K F1
S DEEPHHLP
K ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
